From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:11:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on the Surface Laptop 8
 15-inch

The 15-inch model runs the 13.8-inch model's firmware, which has the
UEFI secure application. Allow QSEECOM on it too, for the UEFI
variables and the RTC offset stored there.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 912d4ca..0aa6d19 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2350,6 +2350,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus13", },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus15", },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8", },
+	{ .compatible = "microsoft,surface-laptop-8-15", },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,glymur-crd" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,hamoa-iot-evk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,mahua-crd" },
-- 
2.47.3

